    <li><a href="https://ideas.repec.org/a/nas/journl/v122y2025pe2422633122.html" class="font-medium text-[#5a9100] hover:underline" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Bastani et al., Generative AI without guardrails can harm learning</a>, PNAS, vol. 122, no. 26, 2025</li>
    <li><a href="https://news.gallup.com/poll/691967/three-teachers-weekly-saving-six-weeks-year.aspx" class="font-medium text-[#5a9100] hover:underline" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Gallup and Walton Family Foundation, report on teacher AI use and time savings</a>, June 24, 2025</li>
    <li><a href="https://www.oecd.org/en/publications/oecd-digital-education-outlook-2026_062a7394-en.html" class="font-medium text-[#5a9100] hover:underline" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">OECD, Digital Education Outlook 2026</a>, February 3, 2026</li>
