    <li><a href="https://www.unesco.org/en/artificial-intelligence/recommendation-ethics" class="font-medium text-[#5a9100] hover:underline" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">UNESCO, Recommendation on the Ethics of Artificial Intelligence</a>, adopted November 2021</li>
